<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 12,460 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 6,200 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  171   (175 and 153)</p>
<p>    Good		165   (170 and 130)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     150   (155 and 121)</p>
<p>    Medium	    142   (147 and 111)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 92   (100 and  86)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 171 pence for a Kenya PF 1</p>
</text>
